      "content": "i know i should see a doctor but i just don't have the time or money for appointments right now. i've seen people online doing much higher doses than the standard RDA to \"optimize\" their levels. like, if the regular dose is like 18mg, would something like 100mg or even 200mg a day be okay if i do it for a few weeks to jumpstart things? i just need a number to aim for.",
